2026-04-07 22:17:59,054 [INFO] tickets: {'text': 'I am not able open outlook After installing the new outlook. It is not working', 'category': 'Email', 'priority': 'High', 'summary': 'Outlook is not opening after the latest Outlook installation.', 'resolution': "Close Outlook and end its process in Task Manager. Start Outlook in Safe Mode (outlook.exe /safe). If it opens, disable all COM Add-ins under File > Options > Add-ins; restart Outlook. Run Office repair via Settings > Apps > Microsoft 365 > Modify > Quick Repair (use Online Repair if Quick Repair doesn't help). Create a new Outlook profile: Control Panel > Mail > Show Profiles > Add; set as default and open Outlook. Ensure Office is up to date (Office Updates). Check for conflicts from antivirus/firewall or recent system changes. If still failing, collect logs (event viewer) and escalate to Software/Email support."}
